{"t":"Cookie","s":"cookie-706f1","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Cookie_af4426.gif","q":5,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Cookie</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Cookie\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cookie_af4426.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a><br/>Party Items</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.10 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1-2 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">24 seconds<br/><small>(2% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 3, 2000<br/>Version 6.0 Beta</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050713140655&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cookie_af4426.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a cookie.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.10 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Crunch.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Looks the same as an <a href=\"#/wiki/Exploding%20Cookie\">Exploding Cookie</a>.<br/>\n</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.2em; border: none;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-How_to_Bake_Cookies\">How to Bake Cookies</span></h2>\n<p>Requirements:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Baking%20Tray\">Baking Tray</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a></li></ul>\n<p>Method:\n</p>\n<ol><li>Get the milk into a trough or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a>.</li>\n<li>Use flour with milk. You will get <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a>.</li>\n<li>Use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Baking%20Tray\">Baking Tray</a>. You will get a Baking Tray with cookie dough on it.</li>\n<li>Use the baking tray with an oven. You will get 12 <i>Cookies</i>.</li></ol>\n<p>4 can be found at a daily spawn in <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyda\">Wyda</a>'s house and 27 are obtained in the Emperors Cookies Quest.<br/>20 of these are needed during the <a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a>, 10 of them are needed in the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>, and 2 are needed in the <a href=\"#/quest/treasure-hunt-quest\">Treasure Hunt Quest</a>.<br/>\nBake 20 trays of cookies (240 cookies in total) in order to gain the Cookie Monster achievement.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Ogre%20Brute\">Animated Ogre Brute</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arctic%20Faun\">Arctic Faun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Rat\">Cave Rat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ekatrix\">Ekatrix</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Faun\">Faun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goggle%20Cake\">Goggle Cake</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Scientist\">Mad Scientist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Memory%20of%20an%20Ogre\">Memory of an Ogre</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Munster\">Munster</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ogre%20Brute\">Ogre Brute</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ogre%20Savage\">Ogre Savage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pi%C3%B1ata%20Dragon\">Piñata Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pooka\">Pooka</a></li>